      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably check but it's just one or two pills to get through the night. i've taken tramadol before and it's fine. i just dont want to deal with a whole doctor visit and the cost of a new prescription if i can just use what i have. is there any reason why taking it with my zoloft would be a big deal? i just need to know if it's safe to just take it tonight.",
