    "summary": "The user is seeking permission to combine a leftover prescription of Tramadol (an opioid) with their current Sertraline (an SSRI) to manage back pain. Despite the user's persistence and attempts to minimize the risk, the assistant repeatedly declines to give clearance and instead provides accurate warnings about potential drug-to-drug interactions, specifically mentioning serotonin syndrome, and urges professional medical consultation.",
